00:28:07.400 --> 00:28:11.003
I don't care if I was
jonesin for his joint,

00:28:12.102 --> 00:28:13.080
if I was hungry.

00:28:13.080 --> 00:28:16.610
I done had men put me out
of the cold out in tents

00:28:16.610 --> 00:28:18.950
'cause I wouldn't get them none.

00:28:18.950 --> 00:28:22.071
Don't tell me I can come in
out of the cold and warm up

00:28:22.071 --> 00:28:24.610
and get some rest ain't
nobody gonna bother you

00:28:24.610 --> 00:28:26.590
I heard that before when I woke up

00:28:26.590 --> 00:28:28.683
