00:28:31.250 --> 00:28:35.203
I can't tell if somebody
done had sex with me on not.

00:28:36.720 --> 00:28:39.405
And right now, let me tell you the Lord...

00:28:39.405 --> 00:28:42.850
The Lord has got you working in my life.

00:28:42.850 --> 00:28:45.680
Can't nobody made me believe that the Lord

00:28:45.680 --> 00:28:48.240
