00:28:48.240 --> 00:28:50.250
the Lord got you in my life.

00:28:50.250 --> 00:28:51.740
You better believe that.

00:28:51.740 --> 00:28:54.720
You better believe that, so help me, God.

00:28:54.720 --> 00:28:57.670
