and your immune system.

00:29:05.090 --> 00:29:08.040
These are facts that I'm
telling you about this drug.

00:29:08.040 --> 00:29:11.190
I gave it a name, I call
it the devil love potion.

00:29:11.190 --> 00:29:13.560
You don't benefit from it.

00:29:13.560 --> 00:29:17.430
I thank the Lord that I'm
slacked up on the drug.

00:29:17.430 --> 00:29:21.711
I thank the Lord for
and every time he fix it

00:29:21.711 --> 00:29:23.311
