00:29:33.460 --> 00:29:36.340
And I had to think that
the Lord is behind it.

00:29:36.340 --> 00:29:38.531
And so I be scared to misuse my money.

00:29:38.531 --> 00:29:41.122
I be scared, I be scared!

00:29:41.122 --> 00:29:43.010
I know where it come from.

00:29:43.010 --> 00:29:45.550
I know it done came from
the Lord through you.

00:29:45.550 --> 00:29:48.690
Bet not spend that money, spend a penny

00:29:48.690 --> 00:29:50.650
