00:29:50.650 --> 00:29:54.690
You hear me, I be too
scared, I be too scared.

00:29:54.690 --> 00:29:58.223
Lord knows I do and I
don't, 'cause if I do

00:29:58.223 --> 00:30:02.210
Lord might stop me from
making my hundred dollars,

00:30:02.210 --> 00:30:03.613
you hear me?

00:30:03.613 --> 00:30:06.530
You know how hard it is
when you give me that money

00:30:06.530 --> 00:30:09.290
