it all the way to the penny?

00:30:09.290 --> 00:30:11.529
You know how hard that is for me?

00:30:11.529 --> 00:30:13.158
And I'm a drug addict.

00:30:13.158 --> 00:30:14.547
How hard that is when
you give me that money

00:30:14.547 --> 00:30:17.230
and I walk out that door to not spend

00:30:17.230 --> 00:30:19.476
