00:30:19.476 --> 00:30:22.970
It's very hard for me,
it's very hard for me,

00:30:22.970 --> 00:30:24.600
and I don't neither.

00:30:24.600 --> 00:30:26.467
I don't spend not a penny on it.

00:30:26.467 --> 00:30:28.430
'Cause the Lord will take that money.

00:30:28.430 --> 00:30:30.670
Just like he blessed me to get it.

00:30:30.670 --> 00:30:32.850
He'll stop me from getting it.

00:30:32.850 --> 00:30:34.500
He'll stop me.

00:30:34.500 --> 00:30:36.750
And any time you would say you,

00:30:36.750 --> 00:30:41.103
I did right with it, I
did right with my money.

00:30:42.176 --> 00:30:46.298
People be trying to
convince me to (indistinct)

00:30:46.298 --> 00:30:47.748
Boom, boom, boom, boom, boom.

00:30:49.360 --> 00:30:52.373
I'm getting stronger,
I'm getting stronger.

00:30:55.636 --> 00:30:58.390
You help us to vent,
'cause we be done held

00:30:58.390 --> 00:31:02.490
so much stuff in and we don't
talk to nobody about it.

00:31:02.490 --> 00:31:03.323
You hear me?

00:31:05.275 --> 00:31:06.811
Huh, we don't talk to know about it!

00:31:06.811 --> 00:31:10.450
But then when you come in
and have to tell your story,

00:31:10.450 --> 00:31:13.860
it's just like going through something

00:31:13.860 --> 00:31:16.460
that's therapeutic for you, you hear me?

00:31:16.460 --> 00:31:21.460
It's therapeutic for me to get the things

00:31:21.524 --> 00:31:25.750
that's done happened
to me to talk about it

00:31:27.590 --> 00:31:29.350
and not hold it in.

00:31:29.350 --> 00:31:30.780
It helps me.

00:31:30.780 --> 00:31:33.100
So, it's so many ways you be helping us,

00:31:33.100 --> 00:31:37.710
