00:31:37.710 --> 00:31:39.153
and get it off our chest.

00:31:40.114 --> 00:31:41.947
So hard talking about something

00:31:41.947 --> 00:31:43.080
that's done happened that's painful to us.

00:31:43.080 --> 00:31:45.250
You be helping us in so many ways,

00:31:45.250 --> 00:31:46.710
they just don't be knowing.

00:31:46.710 --> 00:31:48.900
That's why it's good to bless the Lord,

00:31:48.900 --> 00:31:50.750
for people he be putting in your life.

00:31:50.750 --> 00:31:53.220
And if you ain't trying
to get close to the Lord

00:31:53.220 --> 00:31:55.320
they won't even see that you're a blessing

00:31:56.544 --> 00:31:58.794
when you really is,
you're a blessing for me.

00:32:00.506 --> 00:32:05.435
You're gonna always be a part
of my heart, you hear me?

00:32:05.435 --> 00:32:07.660
You will always be a part of my heart.

00:32:07.660 --> 00:32:09.850
I ain't gonna never let you go.

00:32:09.850 --> 00:32:10.823
I ain't never let you go!

00:32:11.915 --> 00:32:14.110
You hear me, because that
was so important to me

00:32:14.110 --> 00:32:18.480
