what's done happened to me,

00:32:18.480 --> 00:32:19.973
that's important to me.

00:32:22.720 --> 00:32:24.591
That's so important to me.

00:32:24.591 --> 00:32:26.674
(crying)

00:32:29.507 --> 00:32:30.913
It's important to me and don't nobody else

00:32:30.913 --> 00:32:33.029
