00:32:33.029 --> 00:32:35.112
(crying)

00:32:36.533 --> 00:32:39.240
I'm not going to never let you go.

00:32:39.240 --> 00:32:41.251
I'm not gonna never let you go!

00:32:41.251 --> 00:32:43.663
You not gone ever be
able to get rid of me!

00:32:45.430 --> 00:32:50.430
And I mean it!
